            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a fluid control valve that is less likely to malfunction due to contamination. In a fluid control valve V1 including: a valve housing 10 which includes an inflow passage 11 and a discharge passage 12; a valve seat 45a which is disposed between the inflow passage 11 and the discharge passage 12, and a valve body 61 which includes a guide portion 62 guided by an inner surface 14 of the valve housing 10 and a seal portion 63 brought into contact with and separated from the valve seat 45a, the guide portion 62 of the valve body 61 includes a flat surface 65 and a tapered surface 66 tapered toward a side of the seal portion 63.</p>
            </abstract>
